# Short column in compression

An axially loaded short column, written with plain `name: expression` lines.
Several quantities can share a line when separated by `;`.

## Inputs
Ag: 7.5e3 mm² | gross area
fy: 350 MPa | yield strength
Nstar: 1200 kN | design axial load
phi: 0.85; lambda: 0.8 | capacity and slenderness factors

## Capacity
Nc: Ag * fy -> kN | squash load
phiN: phi * lambda * Nc -> kN | design capacity

## Check
utilisation: Nstar / phiN
if utilisation <= 1: "OK" else: "Fails"
